      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "anchor": "overview"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Temporal Boots are the standard enchantable gear obtained in the Glast Heim Memorial Dungeon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The level 130 and level 160 Glast Heim instances drop the Temporal Boots crafting materials and enchant materials."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Temporal Boots Types",
      "anchor": "boots"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "path": "en/enchant/temporal_boots_types.cd3e7eeb5d32.jpg",
      "caption": "Temporal STR·INT·AGI·VIT·DEX·LUK Boots"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "There are 6 Temporal Boots, one per stat, so each job can pick the one that suits it."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Crafting",
      "anchor": "craft"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1 [ITEM:6607|Temporal Crystal] crafts the basic Temporal Boots."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Crafted Temporal Boots plus 5 [ITEM:6607|Temporal Crystal] let you craft the Temporal Boots type of your choice."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Normal Enchant",
      "anchor": "normal"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Slotless Temporal Boots can get 4 normal enchants in total."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "For a normal enchant you choose the option type yourself, and the success rate is 100%."
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "path": "en/enchant/temporal_boots_normal_enchant.dcbc5bb0811f.png",
      "caption": "Temporal Boots normal enchant options"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Hidden Enchant",
      "anchor": "hidden"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Temporal Boots with all 4 enchants done can get the final hidden enchant."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The hidden enchant success rate of slotless Temporal Boots is 100%."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "headers": [
        "Hidden Enchant"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Bear's Power"
        ],
        [
          "Muscle Fool"
        ],
        [
          "Hawk Eye"
        ],
        [
          "Speed of Light"
        ],
        [
          "Runaway Magic"
        ],
        [
          "Lucky Day"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "title": "Option Details",
      "text": "For the detailed effects of the hidden enchants, see the in-game item info or the server database."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Socketed Boots",
      "anchor": "slot"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Slotless Temporal Boots plus 5 Temporal Crystals craft socketed Temporal Boots."
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "title": "Adding a Socket",
      "text": "The slotless → socketed conversion succeeds 50% of the time; on failure the equipment is destroyed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Socketed Temporal Boots can likewise get 4 normal enchants and 1 hidden enchant."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "On socketed Temporal Boots, a failed enchant destroys the equipment, and enchants cannot be reset."
    },
